 "body": "The message `\"Removing symlink failed. Hope that's OK. If not then rerun as root with sudo.\"` appears even when there's no symlink (for example, when installing for the first time). I don't think that a user should be adviced to run it as root in this case.\r\n* check if symlink exists before trying to remove it",
